# Template for hosts/<host>/authorized-keys.local, which is untracked (.gitignore).
# Copy to authorized-keys.local, put the real public keys in, and stage it to
# /sources/authorized-keys.local before the build -- same convention as kernel-config.sh
# and etc-hosts.local.
#
# Unlike etc-hosts.local, this file is REQUIRED: blfs-openssh disables password auth, so
# a build with no authorized_keys has no way in over SSH at all. The recipe fails rather
# than installing an empty file.

# ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3Nza...  john@workstation
# ssh-rsa     AAAAB3Nza...  john@phone
